 7	
 8	## 1. Top-Down Writing Order (Recommended Flow)
 9	
 10	Write each new slice of functionality **top-to-bottom** in the exact order a future reader will mentally trace it:
 11	
 12	1. **Entrypoint** (`main.rs`) 
 13	 Wire the minimal happy path so the binary compiles and the server starts.
 14	
 15	2. **Router / Handlers** (`handlers/mod.rs`) 
 16	 Expose the HTTP route or GraphQL field signature **without** any body—return hard-coded `Ok("todo")`.
 17	
 18	3. **Schema & Merged Objects** (`graphql/mutation/mod.rs`, etc.) 
 19	 Add the new resolver stub to the appropriate `struct XxxRoot`.
