d proper error handling to all endpoints\n- Add input validation and sanitization\n- RunCommand: \"cargo test\" to verify error handling\n- ERROR RECOVERY: Fix error handling issues\n\n\ud83d\udea8 AFTER EACH TODO: MANDATORY VERIFICATION \ud83d\udea8\n- RunCommand: \"cargo check\" (must pass)\n- RunCommand: \"cargo test\" (must pass)\n- If errors occur: STOP and fix before next todo\n- NO proceeding to next todo until current one works", "old_str_start_line_number": 150, "old_str_end_line_number": 168}","mcp_server_name":"","mcp_tool_name":""}},{"id":2,"type":0,"content":"## 3. Now let's update the Rust-specific prompt to require proper todo breakdown
