 src/handlers.rs with all todo endpoints\n- Write: complete CRUD operations\n- RunCommand: \"cargo test\" to verify endpoint tests pass\n- ERROR RECOVERY: Fix endpoint issues\n\n\ud83d\udccb TODO 6: DATABASE MIGRATIONS\n- Write: migrations/001_initial.sql with schema\n- Write: database setup and migration code\n- RunCommand: test database operations\n- ERROR RECOVERY: Fix database schema issues\n\n\ud83d\udccb TODO 7: COMPREHENSIVE TESTING\n- Write: tests/integration_tests.rs with API tests\n- Write: unit tests for all modules\n- RunCommand: \"cargo test\" to verify all tests pass\n- ERROR RECOVERY: Fix failing tests\n\n\ud83d\udccb TODO 8: ERROR HANDLING & VALIDATION\n- Add proper error handling to all endpoints\n- Add input validation and sanitization\n- RunCommand: \"cargo test\" to verify error handling\n- ERROR RECOVERY: Fix error handling issues\n\n\ud83d\udea8 AFTER EACH TODO: MANDATORY VERIFICATION \ud83d\udea8\n- RunCommand: \"cargo check\" (must pass)\n- RunCommand: \"cargo test\" (must pass)\n- If errors occur: STOP and fix before next todo\n- NO proceeding to next todo until current one works", "new_str": "\ud83d\udea8 CRITICAL: YOU MUST GENERATE ALL 8 TODOS IN ONE RESPONSE \ud83d\udea8\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f DO NOT GENERATE JUST ONE TODO - GENERATE ALL 8 TODOS WITH ALL ACTIONS \u26a0\ufe0f\n\nYOU MUST RETURN A JSON ARRAY WITH ALL 8 TODOS LIKE THIS:\n\n[\n {{\n \"todo\": \"TODO 1: Project Setup & Installation\",\n \"actions\": [\n {{ \"RunCommand\": {{ \"command\": \"cargo new todo-api\", \"env\": [] }} }},\n {{ \"Write\": {{ \"path\": \"Cargo.toml\", \"content\": \"[package]\\\\nname = \\\\\"todo-api\\\\\"\\\\nversion = \\\\\"0.1.0\\\\\"\\\\nedition = \\\\\"2021\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n[dependencies]\\\\nactix-web = \\\\\"4\\\\\"\\\\nsqlx = {{ version = \\\\\"0.7\\\\\", features = [\\\\\"runtime-tokio-rustls\\\\\", \\\\\"sqlite\\\\\"] }}\\\\ntokio = {{ version = \\\\\"1.0\\\\\", features = [\\\\\"full\\\\\"] }}\\\\nserde = {{ version = \\\\\"1.0\\\\\", features = [\\\\