{ \"message\": \"Invalid credentials\" })))\n }\n }\n None => Ok(HttpResponse::Unauthorized().json(json!({ \"message\": \"Invalid credentials\" }))),\n }\n}\n\nasync fn get_users(pool: web::Data<DbPool>) -> Result<HttpResponse, Error> {\n use crate::schema::users::dsl::users;\n\n let conn = pool.get().expect(\"couldn't get db connection from pool\");\n let all_users = users.load::<User>(&conn).expect(\"Error loading users\");\n Ok(HttpResponse::Ok().json(all_users))\n}\n\nasync fn get_todos(pool: web::Data<DbPool>) -> Result<HttpResponse, Error> {\n use crate::schema::todos::dsl::todos;\n\n let conn = pool.get().expect(\"couldn't get db connection from pool\");\n let all_todos = todos.load::<Todo>(&conn).expect(\"Error loading todos\");\n Ok(HttpResponse::Ok().json(all_todos))\n}\n"
