 7	- **UI Framework**: `shadcn-vue` (use CLI: `npx shadcn-vue@latest add [component]`), `Tailwind`
 8	- **State Management**: `Pinia` (with stores encapsulating all business logic)
 9	- **GraphQL**: Apollo Client or URQL (calls abstracted through stores)
 10	- **Testing**: `Playwright` (real E2E tests without mocks)
 11	- **Component Library**: Reusable components in `/components`
 12	
